  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity TradeMark Southern Africa Implementation Arrangement with the Common Market for East and Southern Africa (COMESA) is a component of Trademark Southern Africa Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;28,079,998. This project benefits South of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Trade facilitation, Road transport, Regional trade agreements (RTAs).</narrative>
  </description>
